We could establish a competition where teams build games and compete in different categories.

Potential awards include:

* 🥇 Best Overall Game
* 📖 Best Story and Characters
* 🌎 Best World Design
* ⚔️ Best Gameplay
* 🤖 Best Use of AI
* 🎨 Best Visual Design
